	(text "NB: VLINK adjust.\n- Max step down ratio: 1 - (45e-9 *1.48e6) = 0.933\n- So max voltage = 11.19\n- Linear mode selected\n- R_AW = 0 : VLINK = 11.0V\n- R_AW = 5k : VLINK = 5.0V\n- General:\nVLINK = 36.24k/(3.48k + R_AW) + 0.6"
